cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Quantum synchronization in the phase representation: code and notes for the master's thesis"
abstract: >-
  Mathematica code and LaTeX notes for the master's thesis "Low Dimensional
  Topological Lattices for the Transfer of Quantum Information" (Máster en Física
  Teórica, Universidad Complutense de Madrid, 2026-27), supervised by Gloria Platero
  and Álvaro Gómez-León. The quantum van der Pol oscillator is solved with the
  Lindblad equation directly in the phase representation.
authors:
  - family-names: "Córdoba Burgueño"
    given-names: "Mario"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cordoba87/TFM-quantum-synchronization"
url: "https://github.com/cordoba87/TFM-quantum-synchronization"
keywords:
  - quantum synchronization
  - van der Pol oscillator
  - phase representation
  - Lindblad master equation
  - open quantum systems
  - Wolfram Mathematica
